{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Path"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Path\/addArc(center:radius:startAngle:endAngle:clockwise:transform:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Adds an arc of a circle to the path, specified with a radius and angles."}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"addArc","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"center","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial7Point3DV","text":"Point3D","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"radius","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"startAngle","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial7Angle2DV","text":"Angle2D","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"endAngle","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial7Angle2DV","text":"Angle2D","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"clockwise","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"transform","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial17AffineTransform3DV","text":"AffineTransform3D","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol","title":"addArc(center:radius:startAngle:endAngle:clockwise:transform:)","externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI4PathV6addArc6center6radius10startAngle03endJ09clockwise9transformy0A7Spatial7Point3DV_SdAK7Angle2DVAOSbAK17AffineTransform3DVtF","roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method"},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"mutating","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"addArc","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"center","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial7Point3DV","text":"Point3D","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"radius","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"startAngle","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial7Angle2DV","text":"Angle2D","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"endAngle","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial7Angle2DV","text":"Angle2D","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"clockwise","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"transform","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial17AffineTransform3DV","text":"AffineTransform3D","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = .identity)","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The center of the arc, in user space coordinates.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"center"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The radius of the arc, in user space coordinates.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"radius"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The angle to the starting point of the arc, measured from the positive x-axis.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"startAngle"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The angle to the end point of the arc, measured from the positive x-axis.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"endAngle"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"True to make a clockwise arc; false to make a counterclockwise arc.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"clockwise"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An affine transform to apply to the arc before adding to the path. Defaults to the identity transform if not specified.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"transform"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This method calculates starting and ending points using the radius and angles you specify, uses a sequence of cubic Bézier curves to approximate a segment of a circle between those points, and then appends those curves to the path.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The clockwise parameter determines the direction in which the arc is created; the actual direction of the final path is dependent on the transform parameter and the current transform of a context where the path is drawn.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"However, because OpenSwiftUI by default uses a vertically-flipped coordinate system (with the origin in the top-left of the view), specifying a clockwise arc results in a counterclockwise arc after the transformation is applied.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If the path ends with an unclosed subpath, this method adds a line connecting the current point to the starting point of the arc.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"If there is no unclosed subpath, this method creates a new subpath whose starting point is the starting point of the arc.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The ending point of the arc becomes the new current point of the path.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/path\/addarc(center:radius:startangle:endangle:clockwise:transform:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Path/addArc(center:radius:startAngle:endAngle:clockwise:transform:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"addArc","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"center","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Point3D","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial7Point3DV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"radius","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"startAngle","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Angle2D","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial7Angle2DV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"endAngle","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Angle2D","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial7Angle2DV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"clockwise","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"transform","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AffineTransform3D","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial17AffineTransform3DV"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Path\/addArc(center:radius:startAngle:endAngle:clockwise:transform:)","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Adds an arc of a circle to the path, specified with a radius and angles."}],"title":"addArc(center:radius:startAngle:endAngle:clockwise:transform:)","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/path\/addarc(center:radius:startan